    1\uC810 \uD68C\uC218 (0/1)</color>\n\n<color=#8A8270>\uBCF4\uC0C1</color>\n<color=#EBE5D6>\uD06C\uB808\uB527
    \xD76000, note_scrap \xD71</color>\n\n<color=#665F52>[\uCCA8\uBD80] \uC9C0\uC5ED:
    scrap_market \xB7 \uC9C0\uB3C4 \uCCA8\uBD80</color>"
